:P.The library for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*ALLUSR:EPK.
:PD.Every user library&colon. libraries whose names do not start with Q,
and the Q libraries that hold user data (QGPL, QUSRSYS and the like).
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *BCKUPL.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGBCKUP/FLR'.Folder (FLR)
:P.The folder for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *BCKUPL.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGBCKUP/DIR'.Directory (DIR)
:P.The directory for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*ALLUSR:EPK.
:PD.Every user library&colon. libraries whose names do not start with Q,
and the Q libraries that hold user data (QGPL, QUSRSYS and the like).
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGBCKUP/SECDTA'.Save security data (SECDTA)
