:HELP NAME=CRTSBSD.Create Subsystem Description (CRTSBSD)
:P.Use the Create Subsystem Description (CRTSBSD) command to create a
subsystem description.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTSBSD/SBSD'.Subsystem description (SBSD)
:P.The subsystem description, by name and library.
:P.A value is required.
