:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTSBSD/POOLS'.Storage pools (POOLS)
:P.The storage pools for this command.
:P.A value is required.
:P.Up to 10 values can be given.
:P.The value has 3 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. Pool identifier
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 10.
:EPARML.
:H4.Part 2&colon. Storage size or name
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*BASE:EPK.
:PD.The base pool.
:PT.:PK.*INTERACT:EPK.
:PD.Interactive jobs.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a number of up to 10 digits.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *NOSTG, *SPOOL, *SHRPOOL1, *SHRPOOL2, *SHRPOOL3,
*SHRPOOL4, *SHRPOOL5, *SHRPOOL6, *SHRPOOL7, *SHRPOOL8, *SHRPOOL9,
*SHRPOOL10.
:H4.Part 3&colon. Activity level
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 0 to 32767.
:EPARML.
:P.When no value is given, 1 is used.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTSBSD/MAXJOBS'.Maximum jobs (MAXJOBS)
:P.The most jobs allowed.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*NOMAX:EPK.
:PD.No limit.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 0 to 1000.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CRTSBSD/SGNDSPF'.Sign-on display file (SGNDSPF)
