or monthly.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*WEEKLY:EPK.
:PD.Weekly.
:PT.:PK.*MONTHLY:EPK.
:PD.Monthly.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *DAILY.
:EHELP.
