:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PV.generic-name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters, or a generic name&colon.
characters that end with an asterisk (*) select every name that starts
with them.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RLSJOBSCDE/ENTRYNBR'.Entry number (ENTRYNBR)
:P.The entry number for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*ONLY:EPK.
:PD.The only one&colon. an error is sent when more than one matches.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 999999.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=RMVAJE.Remove Autostart Job Entry (RMVAJE)
:P.Use the Remove Autostart Job Entry (RMVAJE) command to remove an
autostart job entry from a subsystem description.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='RMVAJE/SBSD'.Subsystem description (SBSD)
:P.The subsystem description, by name and library.
